{
  "name": "before-you-leap",
  "description": "About to make a big move? This flow makes you think it through properly  --  without you realizing you're learning decision science. Find your blind spots, run a premortem on the plan, see it from everyone else's perspective, face your fears about it, then build the action plan. You'll come out thinking differently.",
